  },
  "question": {
    "text": "If a straight line passing through the point <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> is such that its intercepted portion between the coordinate axes is bisected at&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi></math>, then its equation is :"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>24</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>25</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "B"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img src=\"assets\\st0129_e48a206548e9.png\" style=\"width: 293px; height: 250px;\" /></p><p>Let the line passing through <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> intersect the coordinate axes at <math><mi>A</mi></math> &amp; <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi></math>.</p><p>By mid-point formula, co-ordinates of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>&#946;</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math>.</p><p>Comparing with given co-ordinate values, we get</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></math></p><p>and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mn>0</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn></math></p><p>Hence, equation of line is <math><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>8</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>24</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p>"
  }
}